{"seq":3,"slug":"financial-theory","title":"金融理论","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/economics/financial-theory","introMarkdown":"# 金融理论 简介\n\n金融理论为理解资产价格形成、企业财务决策和金融市场运行机制提供严格的分析框架。这一领域将经济学原理、数学建模和统计推断紧密结合，是金融学研究生进入学术研究和量化实践的理论根基。\n\n本课程从资产定价的核心模型出发，经由公司金融理论和金融市场微观结构，最终延伸至风险管理的技术工具，共设四个章节。\n\n第一章**资产定价理论**介绍金融学中最基础也最深刻的理论问题。CAPM 的扩展模型探索风险与收益的多维关系，多因子模型从实证角度捕捉资产收益的横截面差异，行为资产定价则引入投资者心理偏差来解释传统模型无法覆盖的市场异象。\n\n第二章**公司金融理论**关注企业层面的核心财务决策。资本结构理论分析债务与股权的最优配比逻辑，股利政策理论探讨企业向股东分配利润的信号机制，并购理论则研究企业控制权市场中价值创造与毁灭的条件。\n\n第三章**金融市场微观结构**深入交易层面的市场运行机理。市场微观结构理论分析价格形成的信息机制，流动性模型量化交易成本和市场深度，高频交易则展示了技术进步如何深刻改变了市场生态和监管挑战。\n\n第四章**风险管理与金融工程**提供度量和管理金融风险的定量工具。衍生品定价的理论基础、VaR 模型的构建与回测以及信用风险的结构化和简约化模型，为学习者建立起完整的风险分析框架。\n\n建议学习者在理论学习中同步关注相关领域的经典实证论文，在数学推导与经济直觉之间建立联系。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"asset-pricing","title":"资产定价理论","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/economics/financial-theory/asset-pricing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"capm-extensions","title":"研究生 金融理论 — CAPM 扩展模型","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/economics/financial-theory/asset-pricing/capm-extensions"},{"seq":2,"slug":"factor-models","title":"研究生 金融理论 — 因子模型","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/economics/financial-theory/asset-pricing/factor-models"},{"seq":3,"slug":"behavioral-asset-pricing","title":"研究生 金融理论 — 行为资产定价","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/economics/financial-theory/asset-pricing/behavioral-asset-pricing"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"corporate-finance","title":"公司金融理论","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/economics/financial-theory/corporate-finance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"capital-structure","title":"研究生 金融理论 — 资本结构理论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/economics/financial-theory/corporate-finance/capital-structure"},{"seq":2,"slug":"dividend-policy","title":"研究生 金融理论 — 股利政策理论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/economics/financial-theory/corporate-finance/dividend-policy"},{"seq":3,"slug":"mergers-acquisitions","title":"研究生 金融理论 — 并购理论与实证","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/economics/financial-theory/corporate-finance/mergers-acquisitions"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"financial-markets","title":"金融市场微观结构","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/economics/financial-theory/financial-markets","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"market-microstructure","title":"研究生 金融理论 — 市场微观结构","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/economics/financial-theory/financial-markets/market-microstructure"},{"seq":2,"slug":"liquidity-models","title":"研究生 金融理论 — 流动性模型","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/economics/financial-theory/financial-markets/liquidity-models"},{"seq":3,"slug":"high-frequency-trading","title":"研究生 金融理论 — 高频交易","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/economics/financial-theory/financial-markets/high-frequency-trading"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"risk-management","title":"风险管理与金融工程","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/economics/financial-theory/risk-management","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"derivatives-pricing","title":"研究生 金融理论 — 衍生品定价","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/economics/financial-theory/risk-management/derivatives-pricing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"var-models","title":"研究生 金融理论 — VaR 模型","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/economics/financial-theory/risk-management/var-models"},{"seq":3,"slug":"credit-risk","title":"研究生 金融理论 — 信用风险模型","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/economics/financial-theory/risk-management/credit-risk"}]}]}